# No environment variables are required to run the pipeline, the tests or the dashboard.
# The dashboard reads only the small files in artifacts/ and needs no secrets or network access.

# Optional (development): read the dashboard's artifacts from another folder, e.g. a
# synthetic set built with `python scripts/make_dev_artifacts.py`. Relative paths are
# resolved from the current directory, then from the repo root.
# SCORECARD_ARTIFACTS_DIR=.dev_artifacts/artifacts
